---
// Footer Component
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 mt-auto py-10 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <!-- Brand & Local Processing Privacy Note -->
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 mb-2">
          <img
            src="/logo-icon.png"
            alt="Background Changer - Free Online Photo Background Editor"
            class="w-8 h-8 sm:w-9 sm:h-9 object-contain"
            width="36"
            height="36"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base sm:text-lg">
            Background Changer
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-md">
          Fast, free client-side image background changer and photo editor for instant background removal, custom color replacement, and document formatting.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mt-1">
          ✓ Images are processed locally in your browser. Your private photos never leave your device.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Links -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-medium">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Home</a>
        <a href="/about" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">About</a>
        <a href="/how-it-works" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">How It Works</a>
        <a href="/#faq" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Terms</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-center text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Background Changer (onlinebackgroundchange.com). Free online image utility tool. No registration required.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
